settings-performance-notice = These parameters control progressive directory loading, background metadata probing, thumbnail cache limits, directory watching, and transfer buffers. Defaults are tuned for normal desktop use; improper values may increase CPU or memory usage or reduce responsiveness. Confirm to unlock editing for this session—changes apply immediately, save automatically, and can be reset to defaults at any time.
